error[V2105]: `http.tls` reads `var.certDir`, which has no value when the run starts under profile `staging`
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:19:9
   |
19 |     ca: ${var.certDir}/root.pem
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: `var.certDir` needs `run`; `http.tls` is read once when the run starts, so the vars it reads may read only `var`, `secret` and `env`

error[V2105]: `http.tls` reads `var.perRunDir`, which has no value when the run starts
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:25:15
   |
25 |         cert: ${var.perRunDir}/partner.crt
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: `var.runDir` needs `run`; `http.tls` is read once when the run starts, so the vars it reads may read only `var`, `secret` and `env`

error[V2105]: `http.tls` reads `var.issued`, which has no value when the run starts
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:28:15
   |
28 |         cert: ${var.issued.dir}/issued.crt
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: `var.issued` needs a save, which runs after it is read; `http.tls` is read once when the run starts, so the vars it reads may read only `var`, `secret` and `env`
